l abilities and courage.'),(673,'Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban','en','2004-05-31',141,130000000,789804554,34.5564,8.01,23395,'Released','Harry Potter\'s life is in danger once more as dangerous wizard Sirius Black has escaped from Azkaban Prison and is heading to Hogwarts.'),(674,'Harry Potter and the Goblet of Fire','en','2005-11-16',157,150000000,895921036,35.8119,7.802,22407,'Released','When his name emerges from the Goblet of Fire, Harry Potter becomes a competitor in a grueling battle for glory among three wizarding schools. Signs of Voldemort\'s return emerge as Harry\'s friends help him prepare for the Triwizard Tournament.'),(675,'Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix','en','2007-07-08',138,150000000,938212738,30.5437,7.673,21011,'Released','When a new professor\'s methods leave Hogwarts unprepared to fight the rising tide of evil, Harry teaches students how to defend against the dark arts.'),(676,'Pearl Harbor','en','2001-05-21',183,140000000,449220945,15.4478,6.934,7093,'Released','The lifelong friendship between Rafe McCawley and Danny Walker is put to the ultimate test when the two ace fighter pilots become entangled in a love triangle with beautiful Naval nurse Evelyn Johnson. But the rivalry between the friends-turned-foes is immediately put on hold when they find themselves at the center of Japan\'s devastating attack on Pearl Harbor on Dec. 7, 1941.'),(679,'Aliens','en','1986-07-18',137,18500000,183316455,23.6083,7.967,11013,'Released','Ripley, the sole survivor of the Nostromo\'s deadly encounter with the monstrous Alien, returns to Earth after drifting through space in hypersleep for 57 years. Although her story is initially met with skepticism, she agrees to accompany a team of Colonial Marines back to LV-426.'),(680,'Pulp Fiction','en','1994-09-10',154,8000000,213928762,42.035,8.482,30542,'Released','A burger-loving hit man, his philosophical partner, a drug-addled gangster\'s moll and a washed-up boxer converge in this sprawling, 