d rock stardom.'),(787,'Mr. & Mrs. Smith','en','2005-06-07',120,110000000,487287646,20.4333,6.693,11354,'Released','A husband and wife struggle to keep their marriage alive until they realize they are both secretly working as assassins. Now, their respective assignments require them to kill each other.'),(788,'Mrs. Doubtfire','en','1993-11-24',125,25000000,441286195,15.6236,7.2,6707,'Released','Loving but irresponsible dad Daniel Hillard, estranged from his exasperated spouse, is crushed by a court order allowing only weekly visits with his kids. When Daniel learns his ex needs a housekeeper, he gets the job -- disguised as a British nanny. Soon he becomes not only his children\'s best pal but the kind of parent he should have been from the start.'),(792,'Platoon','en','1986-12-19',120,6000000,138530565,12.2011,7.749,5194,'Released','As a young and naive recruit in Vietnam, Chris Taylor faces a moral crisis when confronted with the horrors of war and the duality of man.'),(793,'Blue Velvet','en','1986-09-19',120,6000000,8636706,11.5744,7.605,3880,'Released','The discovery of a severed human ear found in a field leads a young man on an investigation related to a beautiful, mysterious nightclub singer and a group of psychopathic criminals who have kidnapped her child.'),(794,'The Omen','en','1976-06-25',111,2800000,60922980,9.1421,7.403,2447,'Released','Immediately after their miscarriage, the US diplomat Robert Thorn adopts the newborn Damien without the knowledge of his wife. Yet what he doesn’t know is that their new son is the son of the devil.'),(795,'City of Angels','en','1998-04-10',114,55000000,198685114,9.1342,6.8,2394,'Released','When a guardian angel – who invisibly watches over the citizens of Los Angeles – becomes captivated by a strong-willed heart surgeon, he ponders trading in his pure, otherworldly existence for a mortal life with his beloved. The couple embarks on a tender but forbidden romance spanning heaven and Earth.'),(796,'Cruel Intentions','en','1999-03-05',97,10500000,76347426,9.1942,6.819,3636,'Released','Slaking a thirst for dangerous games, Kathryn challenges her stepbrother, Sebastian, to deflower their headmaster\'s daughter before the summer ends. If he succeeds, the prize is the chance to bed Kathryn. But if he loses, Kathryn will claim his most prized possession.'),(797,'Persona','sv','1966-10-18',85,0,250000,5.401,8.12,2442,'Released','A young nurse, Alma, is put in charge of Elisabeth Vogler: an actress who is seemingly healthy in all respects, but will not talk. As they spend time together, Alma speaks to Elisabeth constantly, never receiving any answer.'),(801,'Good Morning, Vietnam','en','1987-12-23',121,13000000,123922370,7.5583,7.304,3049,'Released','A disk jockey goes to Vietnam to work for the Armed Forces Radio Service. While he becomes popular among the troops, his superiors disapprove of his humor.'),(802,'Lolita','en','1962-06-13',154,2000000,9250000,27.5391,7.3,2271,'Released','Humbert Humbert is a middle-aged British novelist who is both appalled by and attracted to the vulgarity of American culture. When he comes to stay at the boarding house run by Charlotte Haze, he soon becomes obsessed with Lolita, the woman\'s teenaged daughter.'),(804,'Roman Holiday','en','1953-08-26',119,1500000,12000000,11.0821,7.891,2301,'Released','Overwhelmed by her suffocating schedule, touring European princess Ann takes off for a night while in Rome. When a sedative she took from her doctor kicks in, however, she falls asleep on a park bench and is found by an American reporter, Joe Bradley, who takes her back to his apartment for safety. At work the next morning, Joe finds out Ann\'s regal identity and bets his editor he can get exclusive interview with her, but romance soon gets in the way.'),(805,'Rosemary\'s Baby','en','1968-06-12',138,3200000,33395426,9.2373,7.817,4432,'Released','A young couple, Rosemary and Guy, moves into an infamous New York apartment building, known by frightening legends 