ice of National Drug Control Policy, the war becomes personal when he discovers his well-educated daughter is abusing cocaine within their comfortable suburban home. In Mexico, a flawed, but noble policeman agrees to testify against a powerful general in league with a cartel, and in San Diego, a drug kingpin\'s sheltered trophy wife must learn her husband\'s ruthless business after he is arrested, endangering her luxurious lifestyle.'),(1903,'Vanilla Sky','en','2001-12-14',136,68000000,203388341,10.2997,6.827,4742,'Released','David Aames has it all: wealth, good looks and gorgeous women on his arm. But just as he begins falling for the warmhearted Sofia, his face is horribly disfigured in a car accident. That\'s just the beginning of his troubles as the lines between illusion and reality, between life and death, are blurred.'),(1904,'Memoirs of a Geisha','en','2005-12-06',146,85000000,162242962,6.6438,7.637,3424,'Released','In the years before World War II, a penniless Japanese child is torn from her family to work as a maid in a geisha house.'),(1907,'The Beach','en','2000-02-03',119,40000000,144056873,7.5012,6.483,4758,'Released','Twenty-something Richard travels to Thailand and finds himself in possession of a strange map. Rumours state that it leads to a solitary beach paradise, a tropical bliss - excited and intrigued, he sets out to find it.'),(1923,'Twin Peaks: Fire Walk with Me','en','1992-06-03',135,10000000,4237427,8.0012,7.42,2307,'Released','In the questionable town of Deer Meadow, Washington, FBI Agent Desmond inexplicably disappears while hunting for the man who murdered a teen girl. The killer is never apprehended, and, after experiencing dark visions and supernatural encounters, Agent Dale Cooper chillingly predicts that the culprit will claim another life. Meanwhile, in the more cozy town of Twin Peaks, hedonistic beauty Laura Palmer hangs with lowlifes and seems destined for a grisly fate.'),(1924,'Superman','en','1978-12-14',144,55000000,300478449