r and an aviation magnate, while simultaneously growing more unstable due to severe obsessive-compulsive disorder.'),(2609,'Planes, Trains and Automobiles','en','1987-11-26',92,15000000,49500000,6.3355,7.255,2255,'Released','An irritable marketing executive, Neal Page, is heading home to Chicago for Thanksgiving when a number of delays force him to travel with a well meaning but overbearing shower curtain ring salesman, Del Griffith.'),(2642,'Two Weeks Notice','en','2002-12-19',101,60000000,199043242,7.1037,6.366,2242,'Released','Dedicated environmental lawyer Lucy Kelson goes to work for billionaire George Wade as part of a deal to preserve a community center. Indecisive and weak-willed George grows dependent on Lucy\'s guidance on everything from legal matters to clothing. Exasperated, Lucy gives notice and picks Harvard graduate June Carter as her replacement. As Lucy\'s time at the firm nears an end, she grows jealous of June and has second thoughts about leaving George.'),(2649,'The Game','en','1997-09-12',129,50000000,109423648,15.3074,7.575,7451,'Released','In honor of his birthday, San Francisco banker Nicholas Van Orton, a financial genius and a cold-hearted loner, receives an unusual present from his younger brother, Conrad: a gift certificate to play a unique kind of game. In nary a nanosecond, Nicholas finds himself consumed by a dangerous set of ever-changing rules, unable to distinguish where the charade ends and reality begins.'),(2652,'Hard Candy','en','2005-01-14',104,950000,7000000,7.5601,6.804,2817,'Released','Hayley’s a smart, charming teenage girl. Jeff’s a handsome, smooth fashion photographer. An Internet chat, a coffee shop meet-up, an impromptu fashion shoot back at Jeff’s place. Jeff thinks it’s his lucky night. He’s in for a surprise.'),(2666,'Dark City','en','1998-02-27',101,27000000,27200000,12.82,7.324,3268,'Released','A man struggles with memories of his past, including a wife he cannot remember, in a nightmarish world with no sun and 