ter, Snow White, is taken captive. Almost a decade later, a grown Snow White is still in the clutches of the Queen. In order to obtain immortality, The Evil Queen needs the heart of Snow White. After Snow escapes the castle, the Queen sends the Huntsman to find her in the Dark Forest.'),(59108,'Tower Heist','en','2011-11-02',104,75000000,152930623,7.3685,6.12,3223,'Released','A luxury condo manager leads a staff of workers to seek payback on the Wall Street swindler who defrauded them. With only days until the billionaire gets away with the perfect crime, the unlikely crew of amateur thieves enlists the help of petty crook Slide to steal the $20 million they’re sure is hidden in the penthouse.'),(59436,'Midnight in Paris','en','2011-05-11',94,17000000,151119219,7.4691,7.5,7806,'Released','While on a trip to Paris with his fiancée\'s family, a nostalgic screenwriter finds himself mysteriously going back to the 1920s every day at midnight.'),(59440,'Warrior','en','2011-09-09',140,25000000,23300000,9.692,7.84,5081,'Released','The youngest son of an alcoholic former boxer returns home, where he\'s trained by his father for competition in a mixed martial arts tournament – a path that puts the fighter on a collision course with his estranged, older brother.'),(59678,'Attack the Block','en','2011-05-11',88,13000000,6333688,4.9878,6.46,2313,'Released','A South London teen gang must team up with the other residents of their housing estate to protect the neighbourhood from a terrifying alien invasion.'),(59859,'Kick-Ass 2','en','2013-07-17',103,28000000,60795985,10.2906,6.403,6650,'Released','After Kick-Ass\' insane bravery inspires a new wave of self-made masked crusaders, he joins a patrol led by the Colonel Stars and Stripes. When these amateur superheroes are hunted down by Red Mist — reborn as The Mother Fucker — only the blade-wielding Hit-Girl can prevent their annihilation.'),(59860,'Monte Carlo','en','2011-07-01',109,20000000,39800000,5.3041,6.8,2341,'Released','Three young women vacationing in Paris find themselves whisked away to Monte Carlo after one of the girls is mistaken for a British heiress.'),(59961,'Safe House','en','2012-02-08',115,85000000,208076205,11.8517,6.491,3974,'Released','A dangerous CIA renegade resurfaces after a decade on the run. When the safe house he\'s remanded to is attacked by mercenaries, a rookie operative escapes with him. Now, the unlikely allies must stay alive long enough to uncover who wants them dead.'),(59962,'This Means War','en','2012-02-14',98,65000000,156974557,5.8549,6.181,3644,'Released','Two top CIA operatives wage an epic battle against one another after they discover they are dating the same woman.'),(59965,'Abduction','en','2011-09-22',106,35000000,82087155,5.5311,5.834,3043,'Released','For many years, Nathan Harper has had the uneasy feeling that life with his family isn\'t quite what it seems. As he draws closer to uncovering the truth, he is hunted by assassins, forcing him to flee with his neighbor, Karen, the only person he can trust.'),(59967,'Looper','en','2012-09-26',118,30000000,47042000,12.4494,6.911,11047,'Released','In the year 2044, time travel has not yet been invented but in 30 years it will have been. When the mob wants to get rid of someone, they will send their target into the past where a looper, a hired gun, like Joe is waiting to mop up. Joe is getting rich and life is good until the day the mob decides to close the loop, sending back Joe\'s future self for assassination.'),(60304,'Hansel & Gretel: Witch Hunters','en','2013-01-17',88,50000000,226349749,9.7588,6.107,7169,'Released','After getting a taste for blood as children, Hansel and Gretel have become the ultimate vigilantes, hell-bent on retribution. Now, unbeknownst to them, Hansel and Gretel have become the hunted, and must face an evil far greater than witches... their past.'),(60308,'Moneyball','en','2011-09-23',134,50000000,110206216,9.3078,7.298,5879,'Released','The story of Oakland Athletics gener