ld but when they meet three siblings, including a rebellious 15 year old girl, they find themselves speeding from zero to three kids overnight.'),(492188,'Marriage Story','en','2019-09-28',137,18000000,333686,6.7361,7.732,7483,'Released','A stage director and an actress struggle through a grueling, coast-to-coast divorce that pushes them to their personal extremes.'),(493529,'Dungeons & Dragons: Honor Among Thieves','en','2023-03-23',134,151000000,208200000,19.3021,7.358,4797,'Released','A charming thief and a band of unlikely adventurers undertake an epic heist to retrieve a lost relic, but things go dangerously awry when they run afoul of the wrong people.'),(493922,'Hereditary','en','2018-06-07',128,10000000,87796204,18.089,7.294,8757,'Released','Following the death of the Leigh family matriarch, Annie and her children uncover disturbing secrets about their heritage. Their daily lives are not only impacted, but they also become entangled in a chilling fate from which they cannot escape, driving them to the brink of madness.'),(495764,'Birds of Prey (and the Fantabulous Emancipation of One Harley Quinn)','en','2020-02-05',109,75000000,205537933,11.9801,6.868,10903,'Released','Harley Quinn joins forces with a singer, an assassin and a police detective to help a young girl who had a hit placed on her after she stole a rare diamond from a crime lord.'),(496243,'Parasite','ko','2019-05-30',133,11363000,257591776,41.2846,8.489,20989,'Released','All unemployed, Ki-taek\'s family takes peculiar interest in the wealthy and glamorous Parks for their livelihood until they get entangled in an unexpected incident.'),(497582,'Enola Holmes','en','2020-09-22',123,21000000,0,14.2098,7.224,6724,'Released','While searching for her missing mother, intrepid teen Enola Holmes uses her sleuthing skills to outsmart big brother Sherlock and help a runaway lord.'),(497698,'Black Widow','en','2021-07-07',134,200000000,379751131,30.1503,7.16,11406,'Released','Natasha Romanoff, also known as